	(text "Offset-binary samples: 0x80 = 2.5 V = silence; no inverter, no pulls on Q.\nSummer biased at VBIAS 2.5 V, 2k || 8.2 nF (pole ~9.7 kHz), 4.7k class-A bias, 100 uF to LINE.\nLine out fixed level ~0.88 Vrms.  Not yet breadboarded (griffin.yml issues).\nC63 bypasses U32, C64 bypasses U17."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
